  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.0 - Kuwantima: seven new icons, and Avalonia 12.1.6. Kuwantima.DataGrid: Avalonia 12.1.6 dependency bump only.\n\nThe icon set grows from 15 to 22 keys: Icon.Receipt and Icon.Dollar (billing), Icon.Power (status), and the transport family Icon.Record, Icon.Play, Icon.Pause, Icon.Stop - all from Material Design Icons, attributed in the README. The Avalonia dependency moves from 12.1.4 to 12.1.6; among the upstream fixes, keyboard navigation now works inside the DatePicker and TimePicker flyouts.\n\nAdditive only: no selector, resource key or class was renamed or removed. Control count stays 18.\n\nKuwantima.DataGrid ships again under the same number - its only change is the matching Avalonia bump; both packages are versioned in lockstep, see CLAUDE.md's Version Management section for why.",
